# Manually transcribed by OWID from p. 87: the share of primary-school pupils in Tampere with paid
# employment at home or outside the home, as a percentage of the age group still at school.
# NOTE: the exact chapter and volume for this figure still needs to be confirmed; the citation
# below is provisional.
# In case of updating, upload manually.

# Learn more at:
# http://docs.owid.io/projects/etl/architecture/metadata/reference/
meta:
  origin:
    # Data product / Snapshot
    title: "School children with paid employment in Tampere, 1906"
    description: |-
      A study of children's work in the Finnish industrial city of Tampere at the start of the twentieth century. It reports how many primary-school pupils had paid employment, at home or outside the home, as a share of the children of that age who were still at school.

      Because the denominator is children still in school, the figures leave out children who had already left school for full-time work.
    date_published: "1997"

    # Citation
    producer: Markkola
    citation_full: |-
      Markkola, P. (1997). Working children in Tampere, 1906 (p. 87).

    # Files
    url_main: https://www.tuni.fi/en
    date_accessed: '2026-09-06'

    # License
    license:
      name: © Markkola (1997)
